<!DOCTYPE html>
<!--
Title: Limit the Limitations
Description: An interactive project about international students in the U.S.
Author: Nickesha Norris
-->

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Limit the Limitations</title>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="../Style.css/Style.css" />
</head>

<body>

  <!-- Navigation -->
  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#story">The Human Impact</a>
    <a href="#policies">The Restrictions</a>
    <a href="#impact">The Bigger Picture</a>
    <a href="#conclusion">Take Action</a>
  </nav>

  <main>

    <!-- Opening section -->
    <section id="home">
      <h1>LIMIT <span>THE</span><br>LIMITATIONS</h1>

      <p>
        Breaking down barriers to international
        education in the United States.
      </p>

<button onclick="showMessage('How can the United States protect its immigration system while giving international students a fair opportunity to study, learn, and contribute?')">
  Reflect on the Issue
</button>
        Explore the Issue
      </button>
    </section>

    <!-- Student story -->
    <section id="story">
      <h2>The Human Impact</h2>

      <blockquote>
        “It felt like my dreams had collapsed.”
      </blockquote>

      <p>
        Andre Fa’aosa shared these words in a 2025
        interview with The Guardian, highlighting
        the impact immigration policies can have
        on international students.
      </p>

      <p>
        For many students, studying in the United
        States represents an opportunity to pursue
        their goals and build better futures.
        However, immigration restrictions can
        create uncertainty about their education
        and opportunities.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Policy cards -->
    <section id="policies">
      <h2>Explore the Restrictions</h2>

      <p>
        Select a topic to learn more about
        potential barriers facing international students.
      </p>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Visa Restrictions</h3>
        <p>
          Visa decisions and delays may affect
          students' ability to enter the country
          and begin their studies.
        </p>
        <button onclick="showMessage('Visa restrictions can affect students’ ability to travel and begin their education. Check current official guidance for details.')">
          Learn More
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>SEVIS Records</h3>
        <p>
          SEVIS records help track international
          students' immigration status.
        </p>
        <button onclick="showMessage('Changes to a student’s SEVIS record can have serious consequences. Students should consult their designated school official for guidance.')">
          Learn More
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>CPT and OPT</h3>
        <p>
          Practical training programs can provide
          eligible students with opportunities
          for work experience related to their studies.
        </p>
        <button onclick="showMessage('Curricular Practical Training (CPT) and Optional Practical Training (OPT) have different eligibility requirements. Verify current rules before drawing conclusions about proposed changes.')">
          Learn More
        </button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Wider impact -->
    <section id="impact">
      <h2>The Bigger Picture</h2>

      <p>
        The effects of international student
        restrictions may extend beyond individual
        students to universities and the economy.
      </p>

      <div class="statistic">
        <strong>30%–40%</strong>
        <p>
          Projected decline in new international
          student enrollment, according to the
          analysis discussed in this project.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="statistic">
        <strong>$43 billion</strong>
        <p>
          Estimated annual contribution of
          international students to the U.S. economy,
          according to NAFSA.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p>
        Add citations and links to the original
        reports here before submitting your project.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Conclusion -->
    <section id="conclusion">
      <h2>A More Inclusive Future</h2>

      <p>
        Limiting unnecessary restrictions on
        international students is about protecting
        educational opportunities, supporting
        universities, and recognizing students'
        contributions to American society.
      </p>

      <p>
        How can the U.S. protect its interests while
        preserving educational opportunities for
        international students?
      </p>

      <button onclick="showMessage('Thank you for exploring this issue. Consider how fair and informed policies could reduce unnecessary barriers to international education.')">
        Reflect on the Issue
      </button>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>Limit the Limitations | Sources and research</p>
  </footer>

  <script src="script.js"></script>

</body>
</html>
